      "text": "🚨 KOOKY VOTING REMINDER: CODE 101\n\nStarflares and JL stans - it's Kooky reset time! Another day, another chance to collect kookys and power up JL’s journey to take home the 2025 Kooky Asia Star Awards crown.\n\nWhile we save our votes for the final push, don’t forget to drop some for JL along the way. But let’s vote smart: pace your votes, stretch your resources, and keep the momentum steady until August 27 where the real battle takes place.\n\nWe may be trailing now, but backing down isn’t in our vocabulary. In the face of adversity, we don’t just endure - we rally, we rise, we conquer. Let’s make it loud and clear: JL has Starflares and JL stans behind him - always, in all ways.\n\n🗓️ Voting Deadline: August 27, 11AM KST/10AM PHT\n🎁 Rewards: Kooky Trophy, Football stadium ad in Singapore, Outdoor ads in Bangkok and Manila\n🖇 Vote Link: https://t.co/IiyYlNcxKm\n\n#AHOF #아홉  \n#AHOF_JL #제이엘  \n@AHOF_official",
