        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/JLVPTeam/status/1958326202969772311",
        "text": "📢 VOTING REMINDER: 2025 KOOKY ASIA STAR AWARDS - GRAND FINALS\n\nStarflares and JL stans — the Grand Finals have only just begun, and we still have a long battle ahead. Now’s the time to stay focused, move with intention, and play smart. Keep collecting kookys, pace your vote drops, and stretch our kookys all the way to the finish line.\n\n🗓️ Voting Deadline: August 27, 11AM KST/10AM PHT\n🎁 Rewards: Kooky Trophy, Football stadium ad in Singapore, Outdoor ads in Bangkok and Manila\n🖇 Vote Link: https://t.co/IiyYlNcxKm\n\n💡 Daily Kooky Collection Tips:\n✅ Attendance: Keep your streak going to earn maximum kookys.\n🗳️ Vote: Cast your vote in JL's poll—use just 1 kooky and get 10 kookys in return. \n🌐 Community Visit: Drop by JL's community to earn 7 kookys\n❤️ Like Posts & Polls: Like 1 post in JL's community to get 10 kookys, and like 1 poll to earn another 10 kookys.\n📊 Rank Votes: Participate in ALL available rank votes even though JL is not nominated to maximize your kooky rewards.\n     🔔 JL’s active rank votes:\n          ✔️  Best Idol of the Week – ends August 25, 11AM KST/10AM PHT\n🆕 Profile Completion: New accounts can earn extra kookys by completing their profile.\n🗓 Events: Check on top banners for available events which gives up to 500 kookys as rewards.\n\nTogether, we vote. Together, we win. Let’s secure this WIN for JL!\n\n#AHOF #아홉  \n#AHOF_JL #제이엘  \n@AHOF_official",
